  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Parliament&apos;s Capacity for Legal Drafting and Policy Formulation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grant aims to enhance the institutional capacity of the Parliament of Georgia in legal drafting and policy formulation Specific areas of focus will include (i) classifying and updating current normative actscomma (ii) reviewing and modernizing legislation development processes; (iii) introduction of modern policy analysis techniques; (iv) strengthening mechanisms for public dialogue and public participation.  TF099612 The Development Objective of the proposed grant is to enhance the Georgian Parliament&apos;s operational effectiveness and strengthen lawmaking activitycomma as well as improve the public access to legislative information.  The above objectives would be achieved through (i) building policy formulation capacitycomma (ii) modernizing the parliament&apos;s operational systems and improving internal procedurescomma and (iii) establishing mechanisms to ensure the legislative information is comprehensivecomma updated and easily available to internal and external users.</narrative>
  </description>
